{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40502","headline":"医人 · 苏拯","name":"医人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人医在心，心正药自真。\n今人医在手，手滥药不神。\n我愿天地鑪，多衔扁鹊身。\n遍行君臣药，先从冻馁均。\n自然六合内，少闻贫病人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}